# .agents — only project-owned skills are versioned; 3rd-party skills
# (specdev/decide/code-health from `specdev skill install --local`,
# find-crate-source/rust-best-practice from symposium)
# live on disk only.
#
# IMPORTANT: this file MUST stay committed — it carries its own !.gitignore
# exception; on a fresh clone without it, everything here gets tracked.

/*
!/.gitignore
!/skills/
/skills/*
!/skills/dotfiles/
